facts.toolchain:
Flutter is NOT on PATH. Prefix every Flutter/Dart command with:
$env:Path = "C:\flutter\bin;$env:Path";
Flutter 3.44.4, Dart 3.12.2, Node 24. JDK 21 installed (only the hardening program needs it).

