apps/rain/lib/infrastructure/** except the two services above ; apps/rain/lib/core/** ;
AndroidManifest.xml ; windows/** ; audit/STATE.md and audit/0*.md (hardening files) ;
any obsidian-vault file other than the new note.

steps.s:
New file presentation/performance/rain_motion_policy.dart: class RainMotionPolicy { final bool reduced; final bool allowContinuous; static RainMotionPolicy of(BuildContext) }
      where reduced = MediaQuery.maybeOf(context)?.disableAnimations == true || RainPerformanceScope.of(context).isLowPower, and allowContinuous = !reduced.
      Add Duration d(Duration normal) => reduced ? Duration.zero : normal.
